e='background:#dae8fc'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; Main table (employee, project)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='background:#d5e8d4'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; Open catalog&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='background:#fff2cc'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; Fixed catalog (code + seeded values)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK primary key · FK foreign key · UK unique · NN not null&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crow's foot = &quot;many&quot; side. Double bar = mandatory; circle = optional.&lt;br&gt;View resource_v = employee + project + client + catalogs (planner columns).&lt;br&gt;View project_summary_v = one row per project with team size and assignment dates." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="802" width="700" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>